{'symbol': 'KLAC', 'date': '2023-05-04 18:00:00', 'title': 'KLA DECLARES REGULAR CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MILPITAS, CALIF. , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KLA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: KLAC) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.30 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON JUNE 1, 2023, TO KLA SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 15, 2023.'}